# Demo mode has been removed.
#
# Not disabled — deleted. The flag, the code path, the sample consultation and
# every affordance that wrote fabricated clinical content into a real patient's
# record are gone.
#
# It existed for a documented reason: "Demo case" replaced the entire
# consultation object and "Mark Completed" PATCHed that object to
# /api/doctor/appointments/:id/complete, so one click of each wrote a fake
# diagnosis, prescription, vitals and advice into a permanent medical record
# with nothing marking it as demo content. Removing the feature entirely is a
# smaller surface than gating it.
#
# See `shared/utils/demoMode.js` in git history.